    const auto hole = R"({"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["create","get","update","delete","face"]},"id":{"type":"string"},"target":{"type":"string"},"face":{"type":"string"},"parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"string"},"face":{"type":"string"},"u":{"type":"number"},"v":{"type":"number"},"diameter":{"type":"number","exclusiveMinimum":0},"depth":{"type":"number"},"throughAll":{"type":"boolean"},"style":{"type":"string","enum":["plain","counterbore","countersink"]},"headDiameter":{"type":"number"},"headDepth":{"type":"number"},"countersinkAngleDegrees":{"type":"number","exclusiveMinimum":0,"exclusiveMaximum":180}},"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["action"],"additionalProperties":false})";
    const auto chamfer = R"({"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["create","get","update","delete","preview","edges"]},"id":{"type":"string"},"target":{"type":"string"},"parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"string"},"distance":{"type":"number","exclusiveMinimum":0},"edges":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"minItems":1}},"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["action"],"additionalProperties":false})";
    const auto lathe = R"({"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["create","get","update","delete","profiles","preview"]},"id":{"type":"string"},"sketch":{"type":"string"},"parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"sketch":{"type":"string"},"entities":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"uniqueItems":true},"angleDegrees":{"type":"number","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":360},"reverse":{"type":"boolean"},"axis":{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","enum":["worldX","worldY","worldZ","sketchLine","sketchU","sketchV","custom"]},"sketch":{"type":"string"},"entity":{"type":"string"},"origin":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"number"},"minItems":3,"maxItems":3},"direction":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"number"},"minItems":3,"maxItems":3}},"required":["type"],"additionalProperties":false},"outer":{"type":"array"},"inner":{"type":"array"}},"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["action"],"additionalProperties":false})";
    const auto revolve = R"({"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["create","get","update","delete"]},"id":{"type":"string"},"parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"sketch":{"type":"string"},"angleDegrees":{"type":"number","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":360},"reverse":{"type":"boolean"},"axis":{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","enum":["sketchU","sketchV","worldX","worldY","worldZ","custom"]},"origin":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"number"},"minItems":3,"maxItems":3},"direction":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"number"},"minItems":3,"maxItems":3}},"additionalProperties":false}},"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["action"],"additionalProperties":false})";
